/Title (Procrastination Spy successfully demonstrates OOP principles in a genuinely novel context. Unlike standard student mini-projects that only track data, this application interprets data: it detects contradictions, identifies distraction patterns and quantifies deadline urgency. The spy framing adds engagement without heavy code, making the project both fun to demo and meaningful to use.)
