<<
/Title (Instead of accepting a stated excuse, the application interrogates the user and then detects contradictions between the excuse and the real reason. For example, if the user says "Too tired" but then reveals "Task feels too big", the application flags a contradiction. Over time it identifies the user's most common pattern, such as "Too tired -> Task too big, 4x".)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 621 0 R
>>
